	<FixtureType index="2" name="Arena 6.0.4" mode="6 Layers">
		<InfoItems>
			<Info type="Revision" date="2018-01-15T13:17:36">MODE 1 : Created On 1/15/18 By AD3</Info>
			<Info date="2018-01-15T13:17:23">Requires Resolume 6.0.4 or newer (otherwise your deck selection will not work). Free upgrade (55MB) by auto update in app (click, check for updates in the drop-down menu), or online at (http://www.resolume.com/download)&#xA;.&#xA;This is 6 layer composition with an additional layer for strobe and a Chaser.&#xA;If you do not have the Chaser plugin (chaser.hybridvisuals.nl) the Chaser features will do nothing.&#xA;.&#xA;Be sure to download the composition file, along with the DMX mapping .xml (https://www.dropbox.com/sh/3k21zfs38shanfy/AACrUoKd5t1yvtH3kyou4Z1Ga?dl=0) and place both of those files in your Resolume 6 folder under your documents folder.&#xA;.&#xA;Resolume runs and operates differently for each user and user's work flow.&#xA;This is a very basic 40 channel profile that will have your desk up and running for basic playback features.&#xA;If you require more features than what is on this profile, you're probably at the level in your career to build your own profile haha.&#xA;.&#xA;I would recommend each LD to dig into Resolume 6 and try to make a custom patch suited for your needs.&#xA;But if you need a profile.... Here's a very basic one for you.&#xA;.&#xA;(don't mind the 2 extra dead channels at the end, they're in place as a spacer, so you get a nice even 40 channel number.... Or feel free to name and map them to whatever you want. The last 2 channels are currently mapped to the last two dashboard knobs in the composition.)&#xA;.&#xA;Enjoy!&#xA;.&#xA;~A</Info>
		<Info type="Revision" date="2018-01-19T09:01:16">MODE 1 Created On 115/18 By AD3, Uploaded to Fixture Share.</Info></InfoItems>
